rs, it's too late for anyone to respond."},{"date":"2023-02-04","text":"To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can't choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."},{"date":"2023-02-04","text":"You don't have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since \"any number\" includes zero, you don't have to choose any permanents at all, and you don't have to choose any players at all."}],"securityStamp":"oval","setCode":"PF26","skuIds":{"foil":"50a785bb-2584-5009-84c7-71e721565fa2"},"subtypes":["Phyrexian","Angel","Horror"],"supertypes":["Legendary"],"text":"Flying, vigilance, deathtouch, lifelink\nAt the beginning of your end step, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)","toughness":"4","type":"Legendary Creature — Phyrexian Angel Horror","types":["Creature"],"uuid":"832a4763-68e6-5eb2-af92-a03ad130f565"},{"artist":"Mark Rosewater","artistIds":["d9ce77ea-c4b8-44eb-a5ca-a6631050d0d8"],"availability":["paper"],"borderColor":"black","colorIdentity":["U"],"colors":["U"],"convertedManaCost":3.0,"finishes":["nonfoil"],"foreignData":[],"frameVersion":"2015","identifiers":{"mcmId":"895932","mtgjsonV4Id":"f0bcbb29-0c8e-5be2-acbe-1a0127036aeb","scryfallCardBackId":"0aeebaf5-8c7d-4636-9e82-8c27447861f7","scryfallId":"a3339ab7-ca25-48cf-89b8-20373237dda4","scryfallIllustrationId":"aad010e1-9d75-4f41-aa09-9684b247b462","scryfallOracleId":"0c4c37e4-3764-4b12-88ac-bb95a626b08f"},"isPromo":true,"language":"English","layout":"normal","legalities":{},"manaCost":"{2}{U}","manaValue":3.0,"name":"Bicycle Elemental","number":"11","originalReleaseDate":"2026-07-13","power":"2","promoTypes":["playtest"],"purchaseUrls":{"cardmarket":"https://mtgjson.com/links/31073f6f7ffd63